dren":[{"type":"text","value":"T"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Properties"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"metadata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"metadata?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional metadata?: Record<string, any>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1510","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:1510"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Extra information attached to this event."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"inherited-from","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Inherited from"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"CustomEvent.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CustomEvent"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."},{"type":"link","href":"CustomEvent.md#metadata","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"metadata"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"name","children":[{"type":"text","value":"name"}]},{"type":"code","value":"name: \"structured-output.complete\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1534","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:1534"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"What this custom event is. Required: without it a consumer cannot route\nthe value."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"overrides","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Overrides"}]},{"type":"code","value":"CustomEvent.name","lang":"ts"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"type","children":[{"type":"text","value":"type"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type: \"CUSTOM\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1509","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:1509"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"inherited-from-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Inherited from"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"CustomEvent.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CustomEvent"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."},{"type":"link","href":"CustomEvent.md#type","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"type"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"value","children":[{"type":"text","value":"value"}]},{"type":"code","value":"value: object;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1535","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:1535"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The payload. Any JSON value, and required."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"object","children":[{"type":"text","value":"object"}]},{"type":"code","value":"object: T;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"raw","children":[{"type":"text","value":"raw"}]},{"type":"code","value":"raw: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"reasoning","children":[{"type":"text","value":"reasoning?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional reasoning?: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"overrides-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Overrides"}]},{"type":"code","value":"CustomEvent.value","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"extends","text":"Extends","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"t","text":"T","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"metadata","text":"metadata?","level":3},{"id":"inherited-from","text":"Inherited from","level":4},{"id":"name","text":"name","level":3},{"id":"overrides","text":"Overrides","level":4},{"id":"type","text":"type","level":3},{"id":"inherited-from-2","text":"Inherited from","level":4},{"id":"value","text":"value","level":3},{"id":"object","text":"object","level":4},{"id":"raw","text":"raw","level":4},{"id":"reasoning","text":"reasoning?","level":4},{"id":"overrides-2","text":"Overrides","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1531](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1531)\n\nFinal event of a streaming structured-output run. Carries the validated\n`object` (typed as `T` after the orchestrator runs Standard Schema parsing),\nthe `raw` JSON text that produced it, and — for thinking/reasoning models —\nthe accumulated reasoning text. Adapters emit this with `T = unknown`; the\nchat orchestrator narrows to the schema's inferred type after validation.\n\n`reasoning` is `undefined` when the model produced none (most non-thinking\nmodels) and when the underlying adapter doesn't expose reasoning streams.\n\n`name` is a string literal so consumers can narrow directly:\n\n```ts\nif (chunk.type === 'CUSTOM' && chunk.name === 'structured-output.complete') {\n  chunk.value.object // typed as T\n}\n```\n\n## Extends\n\n- [`CustomEvent`](CustomEvent.md)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T` = `unknown`\n\n## Properties\n\n### metadata?\n\n```ts\noptional metadata?: Record<string, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1510](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1510)\n\nExtra information attached to this event.\n\n#### Inherited from\n\n[`CustomEvent`](CustomEvent.md).[`metadata`](CustomEvent.md#metadata)\n\n***\n\n### name\n\n```ts\nname: \"structured-output.complete\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1534](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1534)\n\nWhat this custom event is. Required: without it a consumer cannot route\nthe value.\n\n#### Overrides\n\n```ts\nCustomEvent.name\n```\n\n***\n\n### type\n\n```ts\ntype: \"CUSTOM\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1509](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1509)\n\n#### Inherited from\n\n[`CustomEvent`](CustomEvent.md).[`type`](CustomEvent.md#type)\n\n***\n\n### value\n\n```ts\nvalue: object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1535](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1535)\n\nThe payload. Any JSON value, and required.\n\n#### object\n\n```ts\nobject: T;\n```\n\n#### raw\n\n```ts\nraw: string;\n```\n\n#### reasoning?\n\n```ts\noptional reasoning?: string;\n```\n\n#### Overrides\n\n```ts\nCustomEvent.value\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: StructuredOutputCompleteEvent\ntitle: StructuredOutputCompleteEvent\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1531](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1531)\n\nFinal event of a streaming structured-output run. Carries the validated\n`object` (typed as `T` after the orchestrator runs Standard Schema parsing),\nthe `raw` JSON text that produced it, and — for thinking/reasoning models —\nthe accumulated reasoning text. Adapters emit this with `T = unknown`; the\nchat orchestrator narrows to the schema's inferred type after validation.\n\n`reasoning` is `undefined` when the model produced none (most non-thinking\nmodels) and when the underlying adapter doesn't expose reasoning streams.\n\n`name` is a string literal so consumers can narrow directly:\n\n```ts\nif (chunk.type === 'CUSTOM' && chunk.name === 'structured-output.complete') {\n  chunk.value.object // typed as T\n}\n```\n\n## Extends\n\n- [`CustomEvent`](CustomEvent.md)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T` = `unknown`\n\n## Properties\n\n### metadata?\n\n```ts\noptional metadata?: Record<string, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1510](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1510)\n\nExtra information attached to this event.\n\n#### Inherited from\n\n[`CustomEvent`](CustomEvent.md).[`metadata`](CustomEvent.md#metadata)\n\n***\n\n### name\n\n```ts\nname: \"structured-output.complete\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1534](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1534)\n\nWhat this custom event is. Required: without it a consumer cannot route\nthe value.\n\n#### Overrides\n\n```ts\nCustomEvent.name\n```\n\n***\n\n### type\n\n```ts\ntype: \"CUSTOM\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1509](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1509)\n\n#### Inherited from\n\n[`CustomEvent`](CustomEvent.md).[`type`](CustomEvent.md#type)\n\n***\n\n### value\n\n```ts\nvalue: object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1535](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1535)\n\nThe payload. Any JSON value, and required.\n\n#### object\n\n```ts\nobject: T;\n```\n\n#### raw\n\n```ts\nraw: string;\n```\n\n#### reasoning?\n\n```ts\noptional reasoning?: string;\n```\n\n#### Overrides\n\n```ts\nCustomEvent.value\n```\n"}
